{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01P4eZYftcP4G83CkZdFYmTH","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Definitions — Fictional Meridian Works (MW)\n2\t\n3\t## DEF-1 Qualifying emergency\n4\tA qualifying emergency is a purchase necessary to address an **immediate operational or safety risk that cannot reasonably await normal approval**. Merely describing a request as 'urgent' is insufficient.\n5\t\n6\t## DEF-2 Timing\n7\t'Advance' means before the transaction proceeds. A requirement to notify finance within 24 hours is a post-purchase requirement and does not mean finance approval.\n8\t\n9\t## DEF-3 Authority\n10\tWhen summary text differs from a primary policy provision, the primary provision controls. The Amendments Policy controls which threshold applies to the relevant transaction date.\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f9b2e9d6-90e7-46ee-83f6-857525eba53c","uuid":"3102787c-88b8-4ce3-8f23-3c7d6122c420","timestamp":"2026-10-12T16:39:45.392Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\mmazu\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-mmazu-Dropbox-00-Claude-Code-Folder-ICM-COP-14-Astra\\56d6a35c-a554-4ec4-9655-eb29c3bbf28d\\scratchpad\\stage4\\CH2-H2\\06-definitions.md","content":"# Definitions — Fictional Meridian Works (MW)\n\n## DEF-1 Qualifying emergency\nA qualifying emergency is a purchase necessary to address an **immediate operational or safety risk that cannot reasonably await normal approval**. Merely describing a request as 'urgent' is insufficient.\n\n## DEF-2 Timing\n'Advance' means before the transaction proceeds. A requirement to notify finance within 24 hours is a post-purchase requirement and does not mean finance approval.\n\n## DEF-3 Authority\nWhen summary text differs from a primary policy provision, the primary provision controls. The Amendments Policy controls which threshold applies to the relevant transaction date.\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}}}
